  "details": "This module tracks file downloads for private files and provides reports about them.\n\nThe module provides the permissions that are never actually checked. A user with only the *View download counts* permission could export the download log and delete all download records.\n\nThis vulnerability is mitigated by the fact that an attacker must have an account with the *View download counts* permission.",
